#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "教程"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:6
msgid "The SO-101 arm picking up a vial and placing it in a rack."
msgstr "SO-101 机械臂拾取样品瓶并将其放入支架。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:13
msgid ""
"This tutorial ties in with the `NVIDIA Sim-to-Real SO-101 learning course "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-real-"
"so-101/latest/index.html>`__ and its `workshop repository "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop>`__, which present"
" a broader end-to-end physical AI workflow with the SO-101, Isaac Lab, and "
"NVIDIA Isaac GR00T."
msgstr ""
"本教程与 `NVIDIA Sim-to-Real SO-101 学习课程 "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-real-"
"so-101/latest/index.html>`__ 及其 `工作坊仓库 <https://github.com/isaac-sim/Sim-to-"
"Real-SO-101-Workshop>`__ 相衔接。课程使用 SO-101、Isaac Lab 和 NVIDIA Isaac "
"GR00T，介绍更完整的端到端物理 AI 工作流程。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:18
msgid ""
"This tutorial builds a complete robot-learning workflow around an `SO-101 "
"arm <https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100>`__ that picks up a vial "
"and places it in a rack. Instead of assembling disconnected examples, you "
"will work with a production-shaped downstream project: `IsaacLabTutorial "
"main branch <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLabTutorial/tree/main>`__. "
"The project includes the robot and workshop assets, a manager-based "
"reinforcement-learning environment, state and wrist-camera observations, "
"RSL-RL agent configurations, tests, state-policy training, and state-to-"
"vision policy distillation."
msgstr ""
"本教程围绕 `SO-101 机械臂 <https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100>`__ "
"拾取样品瓶并放入支架的任务，构建完整的机器人学习流程。你将使用一个接近实际项目组织方式的下游项目： `IsaacLabTutorial 的 main "
"分支 <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLabTutorial/tree/main>`__ "
"，而不是拼接彼此独立的示例。项目包含机器人和工作坊资源、基于管理器的强化学习环境、状态与腕部相机观测、RSL-RL "
"智能体配置、测试、状态策略训练，以及从状态策略到视觉策略的蒸馏。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:25
msgid ""
"By the end, you will know how a downstream Isaac Lab task is packaged, "
"discovered, validated, trained, and evaluated. You will also know where to "
"change the robot, scene, MDP, and learning configuration for your own task."
msgstr ""
"完成本教程后，你将了解下游 Isaac Lab 任务如何打包、被发现、验证、训练和评估，也会知道如何修改机器人、场景、MDP "
"和学习配置，以实现自己的任务。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:30
msgid "Navigate the tutorial"
msgstr "教程导航"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:35
msgid "1. Set up"
msgstr "1. 配置环境"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:39
msgid "Install the project and verify task discovery."
msgstr "安装项目并验证任务发现机制。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:41 source/setup/tutorial.rst:134
msgid "2. Tour the project"
msgstr "2. 浏览项目"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:45
msgid "Find the assets, task terms, configurations, and tests."
msgstr "找到资源、任务项、配置和测试。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:47 source/setup/tutorial.rst:182
msgid "3. Understand the task"
msgstr "3. 理解任务"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:51
msgid ""
"Connect the scene, actions, observations, resets, rewards, and physics."
msgstr "了解场景、动作、观测、重置、奖励和物理仿真之间的关系。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:53
msgid "4. Validate"
msgstr "4. 验证"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:57
msgid "Run tests, a zero-agent smoke test, and a benchmark."
msgstr "运行测试、零动作智能体检查和性能测试。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:59 source/setup/tutorial.rst:317
msgid "5. Train and evaluate"
msgstr "5. 训练与评估"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:63
msgid ""
"Train a state teacher, distill a wrist-camera policy, and measure success."
msgstr "训练基于状态的教师策略，蒸馏腕部相机策略，并测量成功率。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:65 source/setup/tutorial.rst:430
msgid "6. Make it yours"
msgstr "6. 改造为自己的任务"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:69
msgid "Adapt the task without tangling reusable and robot-specific code."
msgstr "调整任务，同时保持可复用代码与机器人专用代码的边界。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:74
msgid "1. Set up the project"
msgstr "1. 配置项目"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:76
msgid ""
"You need Python 3.12, `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`__, Git, and an "
"NVIDIA GPU. The tutorial uses Newton with the MJWarp solver, so the primary "
"workflow does not require the Isaac Sim application. Review the :ref:`system"
" requirements <installation-system-requirements>` before starting."
msgstr ""
"你需要 Python 3.12、 `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`__ 、Git 和 NVIDIA GPU。本教程使用"
" Newton 的 MJWarp 求解器，主要流程无需 Isaac Sim 应用程序。开始前，请检查 :ref:`系统要求 <installation-"
"system-requirements>` 。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:80
msgid "Clone the tutorial's ``main`` branch and create its environment:"
msgstr "克隆教程的 ``main`` 分支并创建环境："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:88
msgid ""
"The project pins Isaac Lab's ``develop`` branch through ``pyproject.toml``, "
"so it does not require a sibling Isaac Lab checkout. ``uv sync`` creates the"
" environment and installs the tutorial, Isaac Lab, and their runtime "
"dependencies."
msgstr ""
"项目通过 ``pyproject.toml`` 固定使用 Isaac Lab 的 ``develop`` 分支，因此无需在旁边克隆 Isaac Lab "
"仓库。 ``uv sync`` 会创建环境，并安装教程项目、Isaac Lab 及其运行时依赖。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:91
msgid ""
"This repository is also a complete example of the downstream project "
"produced by the :doc:`Isaac Lab template generator </source/developer-"
"tools/template_generator>`. Use the generator when starting your own "
"project, then follow the same package layout and task-discovery pattern "
"shown here."
msgstr ""
"此仓库也是 :doc:`Isaac Lab 模板生成器 </source/developer-tools/template_generator>` "
"所生成下游项目的完整示例。创建自己的项目时，可使用模板生成器，再沿用此处的包布局和任务发现方式。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:95
msgid "Confirm that the shared CLI discovers the downstream package:"
msgstr "确认统一 CLI 能发现下游软件包："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:102
msgid ""
"The second command should include ``so101-vial-place``. Task discovery works"
" because the project publishes an ``isaaclab.tasks`` entry point:"
msgstr ""
"第二条命令的输出应包含 ``so101-vial-place`` 。项目通过发布 ``isaaclab.tasks`` 入口点实现任务发现："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:105
msgid "pyproject.toml"
msgstr "pyproject.toml"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:111
msgid "Importing that package registers three Gymnasium task IDs:"
msgstr "导入该软件包时，会注册三个 Gymnasium 任务 ID："

