msgid "Task ID"
msgstr "任务 ID"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:118
msgid "Policy observations"
msgstr "策略观测"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:119
msgid "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101``"
msgstr "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:120
msgid "Robot, vial, rack, placement, and progress state"
msgstr "机器人、样品瓶、支架、放置情况和任务进度的状态"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:121
msgid "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera``"
msgstr "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:122
msgid "Direct-from-scratch PPO with 64 by 48 wrist RGB plus proprioception"
msgstr "使用 64 × 48 腕部 RGB 图像和本体感知信息，从头进行 PPO 训练"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:123
msgid "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera-Distillation``"
msgstr "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera-Distillation``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:124
msgid ""
"State-to-vision distillation with the same deployed camera observations"
msgstr "从状态策略蒸馏视觉策略，使用与部署时相同的相机观测"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:128
msgid ""
"Run all remaining commands from the ``IsaacLabTutorial`` directory. Train "
"the state task first: it is the baseline and supplies the teacher checkpoint"
" used by the distillation task."
msgstr "后续命令均在 ``IsaacLabTutorial`` 目录中运行。先训练基于状态的任务：它既是基线，也为蒸馏任务提供教师检查点。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:136
msgid ""
"The project keeps reusable task logic separate from SO-101-specific "
"configuration:"
msgstr "项目将可复用的任务逻辑与 SO-101 专用配置分开："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:156
msgid ""
"This boundary is intentional. A new robot gets a sibling of ``config/so101``"
" and reuses the vial-placement MDP. A different manipulation problem gets a "
"sibling of ``tasks/place_vial`` and owns its task terms."
msgstr ""
"这样的划分是有意设计的。添加新机器人时，创建与 ``config/so101`` 并列的目录，并复用样品瓶放置任务的 "
"MDP；添加不同的操作任务时，创建与 ``tasks/place_vial`` 并列的目录，由新任务管理自己的任务项。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:159
msgid ""
"The registration connects a task ID to the generic manager-based "
"environment, the task configuration, and its default RSL-RL agent:"
msgstr "注册将任务 ID 与通用的基于管理器环境、任务配置和默认 RSL-RL 智能体连接起来："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:162
msgid "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/__init__.py"
msgstr "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/__init__.py"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:176
msgid ""
"This is why the normal ``isaaclab train``, ``play``, and ``benchmark`` "
"commands work without project-local launcher scripts."
msgstr ""
"因此，无需项目专用的启动脚本，常规 ``isaaclab train`` 、 ``play`` 和 ``benchmark`` 命令就能运行这些任务。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:184
msgid ""
"The environment is assembled declaratively with "
":class:`~isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg`. The main configuration "
"connects one scene configuration and one configuration for each MDP manager:"
msgstr ""
"环境通过 :class:`~isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg` 以声明式方式组装。主配置关联一个场景配置，以及各个 "
"MDP 管理器的配置："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:187
msgid "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/env_cfg.py"
msgstr "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/env_cfg.py"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:206
msgid ""
"The 120 Hz simulation and decimation of four give the policy a 30 Hz control"
" rate. ``replicate_physics=True`` allows the same scene to scale across "
"thousands of environments."
msgstr ""
"仿真频率为 120 Hz，控制降采样倍数为 4，因此策略控制频率为 30 Hz。 ``replicate_physics=True`` "
"使相同场景能够扩展到数千个环境。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:210
msgid "Scene and control"
msgstr "场景与控制"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:212
msgid ""
"``SO101SceneCfg`` contains a fixed-base SO-101, a free 20 g vial, the rack, "
"a collision mat, contact sensors on both jaws and the vial, and a dome "
"light. The robot configuration, identified actuator dynamics, and limits "
"come from Isaac Lab's ``SO101_CFG``."
msgstr ""
"``SO101SceneCfg`` 包含固定基座的 SO-101、自由运动的 20 g "
"样品瓶、支架、碰撞垫、两个夹爪指和样品瓶上的接触传感器，以及穹顶光源。机器人配置、经过辨识的执行器动力学及限制均来自 Isaac Lab 的 "
"``SO101_CFG`` 。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:216
msgid ""
"The six-dimensional policy action contains five bounded, relative arm-joint "
"position increments and one bounded relative gripper increment. The task "
"never attaches the vial to the gripper and never writes its pose after "
"reset. Grasping, transport, insertion, and release must therefore succeed "
"through simulated contact."
msgstr ""
"六维策略动作包含五个有界的机械臂关节相对位置增量，以及一个有界的夹爪相对增量。任务不会将样品瓶附着到夹爪上，也不会在重置后直接写入样品瓶位姿。因此，抓取、搬运、插入和松开都必须通过仿真的接触作用完成。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:221
msgid "MDP at a glance"
msgstr "MDP 概览"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:227
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:228
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "约定"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:229
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "动作"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:230
msgid ""
"Five arm-joint increments, scaled to 0.033 rad per control step, and one jaw"
" increment."
msgstr "五个机械臂关节增量，每个控制步按 0.033 rad 缩放，以及一个夹爪增量。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:231
msgid "State actor"
msgstr "基于状态的 Actor"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:232
msgid ""
"Joint state and targets, previous action, end-effector state, vial state, "
"rack-relative target, placement features, and irreversible progress flags."
msgstr "关节状态与目标、上一动作、末端执行器状态、样品瓶状态、相对支架的目标、放置特征，以及不可逆的进度标志。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:234
msgid "Camera actor"
msgstr "基于相机的 Actor"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:235
msgid ""
"No object state: randomized 64 by 48 wrist RGB plus noisy joint state, "
"targets, and previous action."
msgstr "不包含物体状态：使用经过随机化的 64 × 48 腕部 RGB 图像，以及含噪声的关节状态、目标和上一动作。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:236
msgid "Critic"
msgstr "Critic"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:237
msgid "Privileged state observations plus physical contact state."
msgstr "特权状态观测和物理接触状态。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:238
msgid "Events"
msgstr "事件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:239
msgid "Reset-pose sampling and modest vial mass and friction randomization."
msgstr "采样重置位姿，并对样品瓶质量和摩擦进行小幅随机化。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:240
msgid "Rewards"
msgstr "奖励"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:241
msgid ""
"Compact object-to-goal shaping, physical milestone rewards, a success bonus,"
" loss penalty, and small action-rate and joint-velocity costs."
msgstr "少量物体到目标的奖励塑形项、物理进度节点奖励、成功奖励、丢失惩罚，以及较小的动作变化率和关节速度代价。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:243
msgid "Terminations"
msgstr "终止条件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:244
msgid ""
"Successful placement, a lost vial, unstable robot state, or the 20 s time "
"limit."
msgstr "放置成功、样品瓶丢失、机器人状态不稳定，或达到 20 s 时间上限。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:247
msgid "Physical progress and resets"
msgstr "物理进度与重置"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:249
msgid ""
"Long-horizon manipulation is difficult to learn from the initial tabletop "
"pose alone. The project therefore replays physics-validated reset poses "
"across eight phases:"
msgstr "仅从桌面初始位姿开始，长时程操作任务很难学会。因此，项目在八个阶段中复用经过物理验证的重置位姿："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:256
msgid ""
"Training samples these phases as a reset curriculum. Each phase remains part"
" of the same task: observations, actions, rewards, and termination criteria "
"do not change. Progress flags advance only when physical evidence is "
"present—for example, bilateral jaw contact near the intended grasp point and"
" a measured load-bearing lift. Interactive play returns to phase-zero starts"
" so the final policy must complete the entire task."
msgstr ""
"训练时，将这些阶段作为重置课程进行采样。每个阶段仍属于同一个任务，观测、动作、奖励和终止条件保持不变。只有出现物理证据时，进度标志才会推进，例如在预期抓取点附近检测到两侧夹爪接触，并测得能够承载样品瓶的抬升。交互式策略运行会回到第零阶段的起始状态，因此最终策略必须完成整个任务。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:261
msgid ""
"The active reward is intentionally small. Most shaping candidates remain "
"configured with zero weight so experiments can be reproduced without hiding "
"behavior in ad hoc code. Read ``mdp/terms.py`` for the physical predicates "
"and ``reset/curriculum.py`` for the reset distribution."
msgstr ""
"实际启用的奖励项刻意保持精简。大多数候选塑形项仍保留在配置中，但权重设为零，便于复现实验，避免将行为隐藏在临时代码里。物理判定条件见 "
"``mdp/terms.py`` ，重置分布见 ``reset/curriculum.py`` 。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:266
msgid "State and camera policies"
msgstr "状态策略与相机策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:268
msgid ""
"``SO101VialEnvCfg`` is the fully observed baseline. "
"``SO101VialCameraEnvCfg`` subclasses it, adds the wrist camera, and replaces"
" only the actor observations. Its asymmetric critic retains full state "
"during direct PPO training. ``SO101VialCameraDistillationEnvCfg`` "
"additionally exposes the state teacher and a training-only geometry target; "
"the deployed student still consumes only wrist RGB and proprioception."
msgstr ""
"``SO101VialEnvCfg`` 是完全可观测的基线。 ``SO101VialCameraEnvCfg`` 继承该配置，添加腕部相机，并仅替换 "
"Actor 的观测；其非对称 Critic 在直接 PPO 训练期间仍保留完整状态。 "
"``SO101VialCameraDistillationEnvCfg`` 还提供基于状态的教师策略和仅用于训练的几何目标；部署时的学生策略仍只接收腕部"
" RGB 图像和本体感知信息。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:276
msgid "4. Validate before training"
msgstr "4. 训练前验证"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:278
msgid ""
"Start with fast checks. They catch broken assets, registration, geometry, "
"rewards, reset data, and configuration contracts before a long GPU run:"
msgstr "先运行快速检查，在长时间 GPU 训练之前发现资源、注册、几何、奖励、重置数据和配置约定中的问题："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:286
msgid ""
"Next, construct and step a small vectorized environment with zero actions:"
msgstr "接着，构建一个小规模向量化环境，施加零动作并执行步进："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:294
msgid ""
"If this fails, fix task discovery, asset loading, or simulation stability "
"before tuning RL. When it passes, measure the environment separately from "
"the learning algorithm:"
msgstr "如果检查失败，请先修复任务发现、资源加载或仿真稳定性问题，再调整强化学习。如果检查通过，则独立于学习算法测量环境性能："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:304
msgid ""
"Reduce ``--num_envs`` if the batch does not fit your GPU. For the camera "
"task, add the Newton renderer preset and start with a smaller batch:"
msgstr "如果当前 GPU 无法容纳该批次，请减小 ``--num_envs`` 。对于相机任务，添加 Newton 渲染器预设，并从较小批次开始："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:319
msgid ""
"Train the state teacher with RSL-RL. The task's default agent configuration "
"is an 800-iteration run:"
msgstr "使用 RSL-RL 训练基于状态的教师策略。任务的默认智能体配置运行 800 次迭代："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:329
msgid ""
"Checkpoints and TensorBoard events are written below "
"``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_state/<run>``; the final checkpoint is "
"``model_799.pt``. While training runs, inspect the learning curves in "
"another terminal:"
msgstr ""
"检查点和 TensorBoard 事件写入 ``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_state/<run>`` 下，最终检查点为 "
"``model_799.pt`` 。训练期间，可在另一个终端中查看学习曲线："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:336
msgid ""
"Look for rising episode completion metrics, not reward alone. A larger "
"return can come from shaping without a corresponding increase in successful "
"releases."
msgstr "除了奖励，还要关注回合完成指标是否上升。奖励塑形可能使回报增加，却未必提高样品瓶成功松开放置的比例。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:340
msgid "Play the state teacher"
msgstr "运行状态教师策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:342
msgid "Play the trained teacher from the canonical home phase:"
msgstr "从标准初始阶段运行已训练的教师策略："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:351
msgid ""
"The rollout should start from the canonical home phase, pick up the "
"horizontal vial, turn it upright, move it over the target hole, insert it, "
"and open the jaw so gravity seats it in the rack."
msgstr "策略轨迹应从标准初始阶段开始，拾取横放的样品瓶，将其转为竖直，移到目标孔上方，插入孔中，最后打开夹爪，让样品瓶在重力作用下落座到支架中。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:355
msgid "Distill the wrist-camera policy"
msgstr "蒸馏腕部相机策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:357
msgid ""
"Pass the finished teacher to the dedicated distillation task. Add the "
"renderer preset because the student observes wrist RGB:"
msgstr "将训练完成的教师策略传入专门的蒸馏任务。学生策略使用腕部 RGB 观测，因此需要添加渲染器预设："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:369
msgid ""
"Distillation is single-GPU. Its bounded replay DAgger runner begins with "
"teacher trajectories, gradually adds student recovery states, and retains a "
"25 percent teacher-action floor. A training-only geometry head supplies a "
"dense localization target, and sparse stochastic weight averaging stabilizes"
" the final checkpoint. Outputs are written below "
"``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_camera_distillation/<run>``."
msgstr ""
"蒸馏使用单 GPU。有界回放 DAgger 运行器从教师轨迹开始，逐步加入学生策略的恢复状态，并始终保持至少 25% "
"的教师动作比例。仅用于训练的几何预测头提供密集的定位目标，稀疏随机权重平均则提高最终检查点的稳定性。输出写入 "
"``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_camera_distillation/<run>`` 下。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:374
msgid "Play the distilled student with the same task ID used for training:"
msgstr "使用与训练时相同的任务 ID 运行蒸馏后的学生策略："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:384
msgid "Measure the policies"
msgstr "评估策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:386
msgid ""
"A visually convincing rollout is not an evaluation. Run the tracked phase-"
"zero start set headlessly with the project's external callback:"
msgstr "一段看起来成功的运行轨迹不能代替评估。通过项目的外部回调，以无界面方式运行已记录的第零阶段起始状态集合："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:397
msgid "Use the same 1,024-start contract for the distilled policy:"
msgstr "对蒸馏后的策略使用相同的 1024 个起始状态评估约定："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:407
msgid ""
"The callback runs each tracked start once and prints one "
"``SO101_EVAL_RESULT`` JSON record. Preserve that record, the checkpoint, "
"seed, task ID, and resolved configuration when comparing experiments. For "
"reference, the results reported on the tutorial's ``main`` branch are 99.4 "
"percent success for the state teacher and 67.6--72.9 percent success across "
"repeated distilled-policy audits, with no unsafe rack contacts."
msgstr ""
"回调会对每个已记录的起始状态运行一次，并输出一条 ``SO101_EVAL_RESULT`` JSON "
"记录。比较实验时，请保存此记录、检查点、随机种子、任务 ID 和解析后的配置。作为参考，教程 ``main`` 分支报告的状态教师策略成功率为 "
"99.4%；对蒸馏策略重复验证时，成功率为 67.6%–72.9%，且没有不安全的支架接触。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:413
