"The checked-in reset dataset is ready for training. Generate or inspect a "
"separate candidate without overwriting it:"
msgstr "仓库中的重置数据集可直接用于训练。可以另行生成或检查候选数据集，而不覆盖现有数据："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:432
